sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant GDBPane as GDBWidget
    participant IOPane as IO console
    participant Client as gdb.GDBClient
    participant GDBPTY as PTY#1 GDB
    participant InfPTY as PTY#2 inferior
    participant GDB as GDB MI2
    participant Prog as Program

    Note over Client,InfPTY: Startup
    Client->>GDBPTY: ptyx.New(gdb --interpreter=mi2)
    Client->>InfPTY: ptyx.OpenTTY()
    Client->>GDBPTY: -inferior-tty-set /dev/pts/N
    GDBPTY->>GDB: MI command
    Note over GDB,Prog: run attaches program to PTY#2 slave

    User->>GDBPane: Enter "break main"
    GDBPane->>Client: Send (GDB PTY)
    Client->>GDBPTY: Write
    GDBPTY->>GDB: CLI/MI
    GDB-->>GDBPTY: ~ / ^done / *stopped
    GDBPTY-->>GDBPane: GdbOutputMsg

    User->>IOPane: Enter "hello"
    IOPane->>InfPTY: Send("hello\n")
    InfPTY->>Prog: stdin
    Prog-->>InfPTY: stdout
    InfPTY-->>IOPane: InferiorOutputMsg
